  "new_regression_evidence": [
    "Priced gateway requests complete a stopped prefix; active prompts remain incomplete, and later work does not enter older prefixes.",
    "Replay cannot execute again or replace metering after the capture connection closes.",
    "Unresolved requests retain settlement but prevent session completeness; confidently bound other sessions are excluded.",
    "Missing capture acknowledgement prevents new experiment enrollment and cannot be repaired retroactively.",
    "Late settlement advances only the resource revision and requires terminal outcome before cost is complete.",
    "Registration validates namespace, precedes gateway traffic, and detects a different serving runtime epoch.",
    "Fork cost union includes inherited work once and excludes later parent work; cross-session completion references respect the prefix and deletion.",
    "Learning publication rejects changed inventory even with an unchanged canonical head.",
    "Local control IPC acknowledges the same serving inventory runtime."
